    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just that everything feels so hollow. like, if you look at the logic of it, there's no real error message when you stop participating. you just... cease. no one notices the missing data. i keep thinking about how much easier it would be to just exit the program entirely instead of forcing myself to keep running this broken software every day. it seems almost more rational than trying to fix something that was never real to begin with.",
